@@ -28,3 +28,14 @@ For per-title Nakama backend repos, use:
 
 This includes local Docker, Render runtime files, proxy startup scripts, and
 the shared RPC bridge module.
+
+## Legacy identity proxy disabled
+
+The standalone server.js demo's guest/email flows do not establish authenticated
+Nakama ctx.userId. Its platform exchange helper now returns 503 without network
+I/O, even if a backend credential is present in the process environment. Do not
+attach a platform exchange credential to this demo. Use the authenticated Nakama
+backend template, coordinate gateway PR7 and existing callers, and configure
+approved per-game/environment credentials separately. This change does not make
+the demo email delivery stub production-ready. Other legacy demo routes remain
+outside this identity patch.
