+## Distinct variants and additional active paths
+
+- racer/backend/nakama/modules/index.js (b4173814): exchange RPC at line 151
+  still prefers payload-selected ID; internal helper at line 1568 lacks proof.
+  Preserve its product-specific additions when patching, rather than overwriting.
+- GlowPath/backend/nakama/modules/index.js (db178fad): uses ctx.userId, but sends
+  x-admin-key in both paths. Must migrate to the dedicated game key/header;
+  the hardened gateway intentionally has no admin-key fallback.
+- SnakeGame/backend/nakama/modules/snakegame.js (8c44b33e) and
+  color_crunch/backend/nakama/modules/colorcrunch.js (c05ce53f) also exchange from
+  ctx.userId without dedicated proof. Patching their index.js alone is insufficient.
